# Solace-AI Docker build-context excludes.
# All service Dockerfiles build from the repository ROOT (`context: .`), so this single
# .dockerignore governs EVERY image build.
#
# SECURITY (Phase C P2-15): never bake secrets into an image layer. The working-tree .env
# holds live third-party API keys and must NOT enter any build context. .env.prod (prod
# secrets) is injected at runtime via `env_file:`, never at build time, so it is excluded too.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# VCS / tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude

# Python caches / build artifacts (never needed at build; keeps context small)
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
**/coverage.xml
htmlcov

# Virtualenvs / local dev
.venv
venv
env
node_modules

# Logs / scratch
*.log
tests/logs
